extends layout.pug

block content


  article.portfolio-intro


    h1 My Portfolio
    p This section showcases the projects I've built while completing the Full Stack JavaScript Techdegree.
    p Through these projects, I've developed a solid foundation in HTML, CSS, and modern JavaScript (ES6), including object-oriented programming (OOP) principles. I've also expanded my backend development skills using Node.js, Express, and Pug to build dynamic, server-rendered web applications.
    p Each project represents an opportunity to strengthen my problem-solving abilities, apply industry best practices, and gain hands-on experience with modern web development technologies. These projects reflect my continuous growth as a technical professional and my commitment to expanding my development and DevOps skill set




  article.portfolio-project-thumbs
    .projects-box.box.grid

 
      each project in projects

        .cell
          a(href=`/projects/${project.id}`)
            img.thumbnail(src=`${project.image_urls[0]}`, alt='Photo of the project in desktop screen')
            h5= project.project_name

